  tech: ['DSPy (Python)', 'optimisers (teleprompters)', 'evaluation metrics'],
  patterns: ['Define a metric, collect 20–200 examples, compile, evaluate on held-out data.', 'Re-compile when changing models.', 'Keep optimised prompts under version control.'],
