  technical: `Introduced in 2025 as a production-oriented evolution of an earlier experimental library (Swarm). Documented primitives include agents, tools (function tools, hosted tools), handoffs between agents, guardrails (input/output validation), sessions/memory and tracing. As of 2026-10-09 there are Python and JavaScript/TypeScript SDKs, and the Python README describes the SDK as provider-agnostic (OpenAI Responses and Chat Completions APIs plus other LLMs through adapters such as LiteLLM). Feature parity with hosted OpenAI tools still varies by provider and should be checked per feature.`,
